"She has known for fifty years that her teacher's dried bundle is a spirit herb, name unknown."
"The bundle will sit in her box untouched unless a guest tells her plainly what she is and wants."
"She has already guessed Nala is no spirit but a woman in a strange body, and will say so."
"Burning that bundle at the broken wall would turn Old Tusk from the terraces for one night."
"Its smoke would also draw anything else within a few li that breathes Qi."
